<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoValueAssignFromReal"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoValueAssignFromReal</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoValueAssignFromReal</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to set a value to a real number</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Value.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoValueAssignFromReal(
    SilikoValue *object,
    double right_side);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoValueAssignFromReal</function> function
sets the object pointed to by <varname>object</varname> to a
real-number value with the value of
<varname>right_side</varname>.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
